                + "\n대상: 슬롯 " + (selectedSaveSlotIndex + 1)
                + "\n" + BuildSaveSlotStatusLine(record, usesRemaining)
                + "\n요약: " + FormatSaveSlotCompact(record, usesRemaining)
                + "\n다시 슬롯 삭제를 누르면 삭제됩니다."
